# You only need this to RUN THE GENERATOR (main.ipynb / the src/ stages).
# Four stages call an LLM: the invented name pools, the corpus weave, the
# spoken rewrite, and the closed-book gate.
#
# Using the benchmark needs NO credentials at all. Driving the audio into your
# own system and scoring the result (judge.py, analyze.py) run entirely
# locally — transcription uses a local Whisper model.

# OpenAI-v1 compatible endpoint and key.
# The variable NAMES are configurable: see llm.endpoint_var / llm.key_var in
# config.yaml. Which models are called is also config, not code —
# llm.model for generation, qa.closed_book_gate.models for the gate. All of
# them are expected behind this one endpoint; only the model name changes.
AZURE_ENDPOINT=
AZURE_API_KEY=
